{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14246","headline":"立春後言怀招汴州李匡卫推 · 窦常","name":"立春後言怀招汴州李匡卫推","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲斋夜击唾壶歌，试望夷门奈远何。\n每听寒笳离梦断，时窥清监旅愁多。\n初惊宵漏丁丁促，已觉春风习习和。\n海内故人君最老，花开鞭马更相过。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦常","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14246.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14246","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}